description "Naboo Royal Guard

Quick, versatile guards. Adept at disabling enemies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Yellow/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- Naboo S-5 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 10% faster RoF
-- 15% less damage
-- 10% less FP damage
- CR-2 Heavy Blaster Pistol (3)
- 1 Cryo Grenade

^8Attributes:
- 1 Reinforcement
- Security Strength (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[Melee CS4]

The Palace guards were more experienced than average Naboo guards, and were tasked with the highly important task of guarding the capital of Naboo and the palace itself, and were some of the most skilled security officers."